  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "screens-note",
      "page": "screens",
      "x": -340,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 280,
      "text": "Static mockups, Direction A.\n\nTop row is the phone at 390×844 — real screen height, so what falls below the bottom edge is genuinely below the fold. The three Plant boards are one screen in three states: what a scan opens, one tap later, and scrolled down.\n\nBottom row is the MacBook at 1440×900. Not a stretched phone: sidebar instead of a tab bar, and the list becomes a real table, because the Mac is where you enter and compare, not where you water."
    },
    {
      "id": "direction",
      "page": "system",
      "x": -340,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 280,
      "text": "Direction A — Herbarium ledger.\n\nWarm paper, ink text, one saturated colour per meaning: green = the plant, blue = the water action, ember = thirsty. Names in a serif like a specimen label; every machine-made fact in mono so it lines up down a column.\n\nToken names use Tailwind v4 --color-* namespace, so they drop into @theme unchanged."
    }
  ],
